OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOutbreaks of
OL,6,Frain will push northwards during the
OL,7,Fevening, heavy at times. Drier and
OL,8,Fclearer conditions returning from the
OL,9,Fwest overnight. Breezy around the
OL,10,Fcoast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FBright spells and showers,
OL,13,Fthe showers mainly through the
OL,14,Fafternoon and early evening with the
OL,15,Fbest of the sunshine during the
OL,16,Fmorning. Breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
